{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Amazon 為 Apple Watch Series 12 (GPS) 帶來網購優惠，42mm GPS 型號降價 18%，入手價為 US$329。46mm GPS 型號現價 US$379，較原價 US$449 減 16%。兩款均屬 GPS 版本，可配合 iPhone 或 Wi-Fi 連線收訊息、接電話、聽歌及使用 Siri。若正考慮升級手錶，現在以優惠價入手屬不錯時機。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Apple Watch Series 12 GPS 46mm，黑色鋁金屬錶殼配黑色運動錶帶\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/31TDCg-Qg33L.jpg\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n<h2>Apple Watch Series 12 (GPS) 重點功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>心率與恢復監測</strong>：心率感測號稱 wearable 中最準，HRV 最快每 5 分鐘量一次，背景心率每 5 秒讀一次；Vitals app 可看過夜健康、睡眠評分、血氧及月經週期，Readiness 會按活動、生命徵象與睡眠提示休息或訓練。</li>\n<li><strong>運動與 Workout Buddy</strong>：Pacer、心率區間與靠附近 iPhone 上 Apple Intelligence 驅動的 Workout Buddy，可在訓練時提供節奏及心率區間參考，讓用家更容易掌握運動強度。</li>\n<li><strong>安全與耐用設計</strong>：跌倒偵測及嚴重車禍偵測會自動聯絡緊急服務並通知緊急聯絡人；鋁金屬錶殼改用 Ceramic Shield 2，官方稱比任何智能手錶玻璃更耐撞，日常佩戴更安心。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJBCX8VS?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple Watch Series 12 GPS 42mm Smartwatch | Black Aluminum Case, Black Sport Band - S/M. Health + Fitness + Sleep Tracking, Heart Rate, Safety\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31sAe-r-PBL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJBCX8VS?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple Watch Series 12 GPS 42mm Smartwatch | Black Aluminum Case, Black Sport Band - S/M. Health + Fitness + Sleep Tracking, Heart Rate, Safety</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$329.00</p>\n<p>$399.00</p>\n<p>-18%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJBCX8VS?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJBCGY95?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple Watch Series 12 GPS 46mm Smartwatch | Black Aluminum Case, Black Sport Band - M/L. Health + Fitness + Sleep Tracking, Heart Rate, Safety\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31TDCgQg33L._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJBCGY95?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple Watch Series 12 GPS 46mm Smartwatch | Black Aluminum Case, Black Sport Band - M/L. Health + Fitness + Sleep Tracking, Heart Rate, Safety</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$379.00</p>\n<p>$449.00</p>\n<p>-16%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJBCGY95?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>為什麼會顯示沒有貨？</h2>\n<p>如果大家的 Amazon 帳號設定了本地地址，這樣當顯示美國限定產品時是會顯示「沒有供應」，然而大家只要輸入一些<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/2019/05/06/buy-and-ship/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">集運公司的地址</a>，這樣就可以正常顯示價格及送貨。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Amazon 美國送貨地址設定\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"868\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/amazon-us-address.jpg\" width=\"1630\"/></figure>\n<h2>購買美版的 AppleCare 保修問題</h2>\n<p>不少人也對海外購買 Apple 產品的保修有疑問，其實 Apple 產品很多時也是全球性維修，不過 AppleCare+ 的意外換機則必須要原來的購買地才可。那就是你不能買美國版 AppleCare+ 在香港／台灣要求意外更換，必須要在美國更換。不過，維修一般沒有問題，當然每個地區的 Apple Store 也有其不同的。</p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:59:45.891793+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1172,"images":4,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T15:42:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T00:17:33.705230+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T15:53:10.213415+00:00","content_hash":"67edb0d2f1a6b826067d17495c1f1b6b39ca9e62070094b8108025d95ac34c6b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}